# {{lb|pt|ditransitive}} to [[give]]
## {{+obj|pt|&transitive + :a<ll:Portugal>/:para<ll:Brazil>/indirobj&pronoun}}
### to transfer one’s possession of something to someone without anything in return
###: {{ux|pt| '''Dar'''-te-'''ei''' um livro.|t=I '''will give''' you a book.}}
###: {{syn|pt|ceder}}
###: {{ant|pt|receber}}
### to [[hand over]] {{gl|to pass something into someone’s hand}}
