===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|la|do|alt=dō}}, from {{inh|es|itc-pro|*didō}}, from {{inh|es|ine-pro|*dédeh₃ti}}, from the root {{m|ine-pro|*deh₃-|t=give}}.

