{{es-pr|+<audio:Es-dar-bo-La Paz.ogg<a:Bolivia>><audio:Es-am-lat-dar.ogg<a:Latin America>>}}

===Verb===
{{es-verb}}

# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[give]], to [[give out]]
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[hand over]]
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[hit]]
#: {{ux|es|Me han '''dado''' en la cabeza.|They '''hit''' me on my head.}}
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[emit]]
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[produce]]
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[perform]]
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[consider]]
#: {{ux|es|'''Doy''' eso por menos que yo.|I '''consider''' that beneath me.}}
#: {{ux|es|Yo lo '''doy''' por muerto.|I '''consider''' him dead.}}
# {{lb|es|intransitive}} to [[encounter]]; to [[find]] with effort {{+obj|es|:con}}
#: {{ux|es|'''Dimos''' con María.|We '''encountered''' Maria.}}
#: {{ux|es|'''Dimos''' con el edificio después de tres horas.|We finally '''found''' the building after three hours.}}
# {{lb|es|transitive}} to [[hit]] [[upon]]
# {{lb|es|intransitive|colloquial}} to [[press]], [[activate]] {{+obj|es|:a<a button, mechanism, etc.>}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|'''dar'''le al botón|to '''press''' the button}}
# {{lb|es|transitive|colloquial}} to [[ruin]]; [[mess up]]
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|Me '''dio''' la noche|It '''ruined''' the night for me}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive}} to [[occur]]
# {{lb|es|reflexive}} to [[grow]] naturally
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|El maíz '''se da''' en esta tierra.|Corn '''grows''' on this land.}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive}} to [[hit]]
#: {{ux|es|El coche se '''dio''' con/contra un árbol.|The car '''hit''' a tree.}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive}} to [[assume]] {{+obj|es|:por(past&part)<to be in some state>}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|'''darse''' por vencido|to '''assume''' to be defeated}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|'''darse''' por muerto|to '''assume''' to be dead}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive|informal}} to [[pretend]] to be, to [[present]] oneself [[as though]] one were
#: {{ux|es|'''Se las da''' de enfermero pero nunca ha estudiado.|He '''pretends''' to be a nurse, but he's never studied.}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive|Mexico}} to [[surrender]]
#: {{ux|es|¿'''Te das'''? — '''Me doy'''.|Do you '''surrender'''? — I '''surrender'''.}}
# {{lb|es|reflexive|transitive|vulgar|El Salvador}} to fuck {{q|used with third person direct objects only}}
#: {{ux|es|Vos solo '''te''' la '''das'''.|You just '''fuck''' her.}}
#: {{ux|es|'''Me''' quiero '''dar''' a José.|I want to '''fuck''' José.}}
# {{lb|es|transitive|colloquial|Rioplatense}} to find someone sexually attractive (mostly to have a sexual encounter with)
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|Le re '''doy'''.|t=I '''think she/he is really hot'''.}}
# {{lb|es|transitive|of weather}} to [[announce]], [[predict]]
#: {{ux|inline=1|es|'''Dan''' lluvia.|They '''announced''' rain.}}

